{"id":"en_three-years-as-a-simp-to-activate-the-system","title":"Three Years as a Simp to Activate the System","titleEn":"Three Years as a Simp to Activate the System","description":"A man finds himself inhabiting the body of Leo Smith, a general's son in the Empire of Flame, with only three days left before his whole family faces execution. Just as despair takes hold, the system shifts his mission toward Layla Sanchez, the fiancée he once had, and he learns her feelings for him are already at their peak. Armed with modern weaponry drawn from the system's store, Leo ultimately takes the capital, brings down the emperor, and crowns himself ruler. Those interested can follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/three-years-as-a-simp-to-activate-the-system/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/three-years-as-a-simp-to-activate-the-system/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Animation","Redemption","Sabotaging","Sharp-tongued","High Fantasy","Regret"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_three-years-as-a-simp-to-activate-the-system_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_three-years-as-a-simp-to-activate-the-system_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_three-years-as-a-simp-to-activate-the-system_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep